        "TileImage": "$($repository b274e60e-0aae-4c3f-bfdd-9db8f9e83d10).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.  You have been tasked with eliminating Khaleel Humam Harb, a notorious dead beat turned Pokemon scalper currently living in his mother&apos;s basement in Morroco. \rHumam is responsible for the increase in booster packs of up to 500% and our client,  MI6, need to stabilize the region&apos;s booster pack prices without getting their hands dirty. They have specifically requested for him to be eliminated by the MO of a local gang, to send a message to all scalpers who may follow in his path.",
